 "speech": {
  "language": "en",
  "text": "90 % of traders will never see a payout and here's why. Not because the prop firm is rigged, not because the spreads are bad, not because of news volatility. It's because of behavior. Here's what actually happens. They start disciplined. Risk is controlled, trades are clean. They follow their plan. Then they get close to the profit target and something changes. They increase size, they force setups, they trade out of boredom, they revenge trade one loss. And in one emotional decision, they erase weeks of discipline. The market didn't beat them. Imposted. Funded trading isn't about being right. It's about surviving long enough to get paid. The traders who get payouts, they treat the account like a business, not a lottery ticket.",
